22340,simple,HSU-14HFTEX,,"Haier T3 Plus 1.0 Ton Inverter Split AC (Heat &amp; Cool, HSU-14HFTEX/013WDC-DG)",-1,0,visible,"<p data-path-to-node=""10"">Beat the most extreme summer heat with the Haier 1.0 Ton T3 Plus Inverter AC (HSU-14HFTEX). Finished in a premium Dark Grey (DG), this Heat &amp; Cool split AC is powered by an ultra-durable T3 compressor that guarantees stable operation up to 70°C and full cooling capacity at 53°C. It features Smart Wi-Fi control, self-cleaning technology, 4D airflow, and eco-friendly R32 refrigerant. Enjoy ultimate peace of mind with Haier's comprehensive 10-Year Compressor, 5-Year PCB, and 5-Year Parts Warranty.</p>
\n
\n<h3 data-path-to-node=""12""></h3>","<h2>Extreme Cooling Powered by T3 Plus Inverter</h2>
\n<p>Never worry about your AC tripping during peak summer again. The <strong>Haier HSU-14HFTEX T3 Plus Inverter AC</strong> is engineered specifically for extreme climates. Equipped with an advanced heavy-duty T3 compressor, this 1.0 Ton (14,500 BTU) unit provides incredibly stable cooling operation even when outside temperatures hit 70°C, and delivers 100% full BTU output at 53°C. Wrapped in a sleek Dark Grey (DG) finish with a hidden LED display, it seamlessly elevates the modern aesthetics of your room.</p>
\n
\n<h2>Smart Features &amp; All-Season Comfort</h2>
\n<p>Take complete control of your climate year-round with built-in Heat and Cool functionality. The integrated Smart Wi-Fi allows you to control temperatures, monitor energy usage, and schedule cooling directly from your smartphone. Maintenance is hassle-free thanks to the automated Self-Clean technology and anti-corrosion coating that protects the condenser from rust. Combining these features with the highly efficient and eco-friendly R32 refrigerant ensures your room cools faster while saving massive amounts of energy.</p>
\n
\n<h3>Key Features</h3>
\n<ul>
\n  <li><strong>1.0 Ton / 14,500 BTU:</strong> Powerful enough to quickly cool standard-sized bedrooms and office spaces.</li>
\n  <li><strong>T3 Plus Compressor:</strong> Unmatched durability offering stable operation up to 70°C and full cooling at 53°C.</li>
\n  <li><strong>Smart Wi-Fi Control:</strong> Manage your AC remotely using your smartphone from anywhere in the world.</li>
\n  <li><strong>Heat &amp; Cool Functionality:</strong> Dual-purpose climate control for blistering summers and freezing winters.</li>
\n  <li><strong>Self-Clean Technology:</strong> Automatically washes away dust and dries internal moisture to prevent mold and odors.</li>
\n  <li><strong>Comprehensive Warranty:</strong> Backed by a massive 10-Year Compressor, 5-Year PCB, and 5-Year Parts Warranty.</li>
\n</ul>
\n
\n<h3 style=""margin-top: 30px;border-bottom: 1px solid #ededed;padding-bottom: 10px;margin-bottom: 20px"">FAQs</h3>
\n
\n<div style=""margin-bottom: 20px"">
\n  <strong style=""font-size: 16px;color: #222;font-family: var(--wd-title-font)"">Q1: Will this AC trip in extreme summer heat?</strong>
\n  <p style=""margin-top: 5px;margin-bottom: 0""><strong>A:</strong> No, the T3 Plus compressor is specifically designed for extreme climates and guarantees stable, uninterrupted operation even at 70°C.</p>
\n</div>
\n
\n<div style=""margin-bottom: 20px"">
\n  <strong style=""font-size: 16px;color: #222;font-family: var(--wd-title-font)"">Q2: Can I use this AC during the winter?</strong>
\n  <p style=""margin-top: 5px;margin-bottom: 0""><strong>A:</strong> Yes, this model features built-in Heat &amp; Cool functionality, making it a complete year-round climate solution for your room.</p>
\n</div>
\n
\n<div style=""margin-bottom: 20px"">
\n  <strong style=""font-size: 16px;color: #222;font-family: var(--wd-title-font)"">Q3: Can I control the AC with my mobile phone?</strong>
\n  <p style=""margin-top: 5px;margin-bottom: 0""><strong>A:</strong> Absolutely. It comes with built-in Wi-Fi connectivity, allowing you to control the settings and monitor performance remotely via the Haier smart app.</p>
\n</div>
\n
\n<div style=""margin-bottom: 20px"">
\n  <strong style=""font-size: 16px;color: #222;font-family: var(--wd-title-font)"">Q4: Does it require professional cleaning frequently?</strong>
\n  <p style=""margin-top: 5px;margin-bottom: 0""><strong>A:</strong> Thanks to the automated Self-Clean technology, the indoor unit can flush out dust and moisture on its own, significantly reducing the need for manual service calls.</p>
\n</div>
\n
\n<div style=""margin-bottom: 20px"">
\n  <strong style=""font-size: 16px;color: #222;font-family: var(--wd-title-font)"">Q5: What is the official warranty coverage?</strong>
\n  <p style=""margin-top: 5px;margin-bottom: 0""><strong>A:</strong> Haier provides an exceptional 10-Year Compressor Warranty, 5-Year PCB Warranty, and a 5-Year Parts Warranty for complete peace of mind.</p>
